WEBVTT

00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:06.281
Setting up routes

00:00:06.331 --> 00:00:10.099
Open Transport and Routes, then press Add Route.

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:26.237
Enter the route name, where it starts, where it ends, and the estimated minutes.

00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:47.345
Press Create Route. The route appears in the list.

00:00:56.343 --> 00:00:59.657
Press Stops on the route, then Add Stop.

00:01:04.483 --> 00:01:08.037
Name the stop and set the pickup and drop times.

00:01:20.533 --> 00:01:25.817
Press Add Stop. The stop shows in the route with its order and times.

00:01:29.729 --> 00:01:34.410
Route ready
